To ensure that Nethack conforms to the legislation that seems likely to be
passed in Britain (except Scotland where similar legislation already
applies), I've written a small patch to dissuade Nethack players from using
dogs to hunt foxes. I would encourage players in Scotland to apply it
immediately, and all other British-based players to apply it before the
legislation comes into force.


It's not very long, so the patch is included below.


